OL,3,ABusted's James Bourne says 'hero'
OL,4,Abrother saved his life with kidney
OL,5,Adonation
OL,6,
OL,7,FJames later said he needed major
OL,8,Fsurgery to "extend my life", and has
OL,9,Fnow thanked his "hero" Chris and said
OL,10,Fthey are both recovering from their
OL,11,Ftransplant operations.
